# Cursor AI Rules for ProjectSiluma

## Pre-Deploy Checklist

Before deploying to Railway, ALWAYS:
1. Run syntax check: `python3 -m py_compile <file>` for any modified Python files
2. Run full syntax check: `./pre_deploy_check.sh` before `railway up`
3. Check for linter errors: `read_lints` tool for modified files

## Deployment Workflow

When deploying:
1. Make code changes
2. Run syntax check on modified files
3. Fix any syntax errors
4. Commit changes
5. Run `./pre_deploy_check.sh` to verify all files
6. Deploy with `railway up`

## Python Syntax Check

Always validate Python syntax before committing/deploying:
- Use `python3 -m py_compile <file>` for individual files
- Use `./pre_deploy_check.sh` for all files
- Common issues: IndentationError, SyntaxError

